<title>How can we best help you?</title>

<p>What are ways in which we can better help you learn in Math 1241?</p>
<answer selectMultiple="true">
  <choiceInput name="ci1">
    <choice>Hold office hours at different times</choice>
    <choice>Hold review sessions outside class</choice>
    <choice>Other (specify below)</choice>
    <choice>Nothing, just keep doing what you're doing</choice>
  </choiceInput>
  <award><when>$ci1.selectedIndex > 0</when></award>
</answer>



<p>If you have other requests, specify them here:
<textInput expanded="true" />
</p>

<p>For office hours, what format do you prefer?</p>
<answer>
  <choice credit="1">Strong preference for in person</choice>
  <choice credit="1">Strong preference for on zoom</choice>
  <choice credit="1">Preference for in person, but on zoom is OK if needed for scheduling</choice>
  <choice credit="1">No preference or wouldn't attend office hours</choice>
</answer>


<p>If review sessions would be helpful, what format would you prefer?</p>
<answer>
  <choice credit="1">In a classroom during the day</choice>
  <choice credit="1">In a classroom during the evening</choice>
  <choice credit="1">At Prof. Nykamp's house during the evening</choice>
  <choice credit="1">No preference or wouldn't attend review sessions</choice>
</answer>

<p>If you are interested in coming to office hours or a review session, you can fill out <ref to="https://whenisgood.net/saws223">this poll</ref> to indicate when you are available. (It asks for your name; you don't have to put your real name.)
</p>

<p>Filled out poll?
<answer inline="true"><choice credit="1">yes</choice><choice credit="1">no</choice></answer>
</p>


